{"pageid":3463,"title":"Version 1.18.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.18.0</span>","revid":15576,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.1.8.0\">Version 1.1.8.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 5th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_Content:\">New Content:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added the long awaited <a href=\"/wiki/Trapezoid\" title=\"Trapezoid\">Trapezoid Schematic</a>! Can be used to make hexagons</li>\n<li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Flag_Pole\" title=\"Flag Pole\">flag pole</a> for 4th of July, this will not be limited</li>\n<li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Glass_Hatch\" title=\"Glass Hatch\">glass hatch</a>, can be used for glass windows and trapdoors!</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed issue with certain boxes (<a href=\"/wiki/Glass_Hatch\" title=\"Glass Hatch\">glass door</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flat_Door\" title=\"Flat Door\">flat door</a>, etc) displaying purchase value after being bought</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.18.1\">Version 1.18.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 5th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed <a href=\"/wiki/Elevator\" title=\"Elevator\">Elevator</a> interaction not working when large</li>\n<li>Fixed Architect gamepass not giving new schematic</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163728\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 19/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,tem